{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"暂不安排喜欢的去向、让眼前的亲近自然发生，都是心理态度，没有新增具体场景或外部事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"不索求回应、不总查看对方反应以及自在关心都属于心理状态，没有把珠子里的目光或亲近意象落实成具体互动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"表达当下觉得安静亲近已经足够，没有把耳语、肩膀相挨或安静坐着等比喻写成真实场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"相处舒服使他舍不得这一刻过去、时间仍在流逝，是对当下感受的概括，没有新增往事或把音乐变化当成心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"热情涌起后又因不敢全然交付心意而收住，写的是心理起伏，没有把情感变热写成实际说话或其他具体动作。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"喜欢尚轻且不稳、又舍不得放下，足以支持他暂不安排去向而顺着眼前的亲近。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"他怕心意显露过多会改变关系，这正解释了热情升起后为什么仍会收住。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线也能看出他从不急于安排关系、放下对回应的要求，到满足于当下、舍不得这一刻过去，最后又在热情与顾虑之间收住。 \",\n  \"lost\": [],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S02-1\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"“暂且不替喜欢安排去向”几乎复述了S01-3的“眼下还没非得决定关系去向”，后半句才新增让眼前亲近自然发生的态度，前半句可以删去。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S02-5\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"“还不敢把心意全交出去而慢慢收住”与S01-2已经说过的怕心意显露过多、靠近时收住高度重叠，热情上涌再回落是新内容，但限制原因可以借跨段箭头承接而不必再次展开。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c1c89685-f6de-4db7-8e97-b6f228453ce9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T150501255085Z", "elapsed_seconds": 698.937, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T15:16:40.205907+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0049a5fa08a9be5fe07182914845e445428af5d838a192bbca05e67802c5692e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T150501255085Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "4207ddf98953251b9246d7e72df97bbcedb796ec51cc3da22f698a200aa4833b"}}}
